---
title: AgentX Pipeline Lifecycle — State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted: Client submits pipeline run

    Submitted --> Validating: Supervisor created
    Validating --> Planning: YAML valid, DAG built
    Validating --> Failed: Invalid YAML / missing agents

    Planning --> Dispatching: DAG resolved, agents allocated
    Note right of Planning: Supervisor creates Agent DOs<br/>Assigns roles from YAML<br/>Sets memory budgets

    Dispatching --> Running: Tasks pushed to Queue
    Note right of Dispatching: Parallel agents dispatched<br/>simultaneously for parallel steps

    Running --> GateCheck: Agent(s) completed
    Note right of Running: Each agent works independently<br/>LLM calls, tool use, R2 writes

    GateCheck --> Dispatching: Gate PASS, more steps remain
    GateCheck --> Recovery: Gate FAIL
    GateCheck --> Completing: Gate PASS, final step done

    state Recovery {
        [*] --> Retrying
        Retrying --> RetryGate: Agent re-executed
        RetryGate --> [*]: Retry PASS
        RetryGate --> Fallback: Retry FAIL
        Fallback --> FallbackGate: Fallback agent ran
        FallbackGate --> [*]: Fallback PASS
        FallbackGate --> HumanEscalation: Fallback FAIL
        HumanEscalation --> [*]: Human resolved
    end

    Recovery --> Dispatching: Recovery succeeded, resume pipeline
    Recovery --> Failed: Recovery exhausted, pipeline aborted

    Completing --> Completed: Output written to R2
    Note right of Completing: Supervisor collects all artifacts<br/>Writes final output<br/>Records metrics

    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    Note right of Failed: Full audit trail preserved<br/>in Supervisor DO storage
